@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Mixed MVP / future. Retained broader-product associations require explicit future node labels; MVP uses only core/basic ProjectForge.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AAEB7
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #7B919E
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title MVP + EXPLICIT FUTURE PATHS — SB-M08 — Local calendar action versus selected provider synchronization
actor User as U
participant "Calendar activity" as A
participant "Provider connection / mapping" as C
participant "[AFTER MVP] Selected Google Calendar (external)" as G
U -> A : Request intended activity or synchronization action
A -> A : Evaluate authority and explicit time/context
alt Denied or invalid time / context
 A --> U : Denied / validation result
else Permitted
 alt Local-only activity change
  A -> A : Retain permitted local content / association
  A --> U : Actual local save result
 else Separate selected synchronization request
  A -> C : Evaluate intended mapping and provider authority
  alt Disconnected, revoked or ineligible
   C --> U : No provider action; explicit disconnected result
  else Eligible future provider interaction
   C -> G : Read current mapped event / version
   G --> C : Permitted current data or unavailable / unknown
   C -> C : Evaluate reviewed direction and conflict conditions
   alt Conflict, ineligible or unknown input
    C --> U : Explicit conflict / uncertainty; no blind overwrite
   else Permitted evaluated context
    opt Explicitly requested eligible provider write
     C -> G : Request only the permitted evaluated change
     G --> C : Actual confirmed / failed / unknown result
    end
    alt Required outcome confirmed
     C -> A : Reconcile mapped fields; preserve local-only meaning
     A --> U : Actual selected synchronization result
    else Unsuccessful or unknown outcome
     C --> U : Actual failed / unknown state; reconcile before retry
    end
   end
  end
 end
end
note over A,G
Local save does not automatically publish to Google.
A reminder intention is not proof of actual delivery.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
